    "file": "app/services/relative_time.py",
    "replace": "    total = int(max(0.0, seconds))",
    "with": "    total = int(seconds)",
    "test": "tests/test_how_long_ago_is_said_one_way.py::test_a_time_in_the_future_never_shows_a_negative_number"
  },
  {
    "label": "T3 花了多久進位成 1 分鐘（2 秒就答完的顯示成「1 分鐘」——那正好是「它到底有沒有在想」最在意的區間）",
    "file": "app/services/relative_time.py",
    "replace": "    if seconds < MINUTE:\n        return t(\"time.under_a_minute\")",
    "with": "    if seconds < 1:\n        return t(\"time.under_a_minute\")",
    "test": "tests/test_how_long_ago_is_said_one_way.py::test_a_two_second_answer_is_not_rounded_up_to_a_minute"
  },
  {
